 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "jobs[i] = [jobId, start \"HHMM\", duration minutes as a decimal string], in non-decreasing start order. Process jobs in order. A machine is free for a job when its last job ends (start + duration) at or before the job's start. Assign the job to the free machine with the smallest number; if none is free, open a new machine numbered one more than the current count. Machines are named \"M1\", \"M2\", .... Return [jobId, machine name] for every job in input order.",
